{"steam_appid":3091140,"steam_name":"Lootbound","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/1922420678/55889685cd246b40514dd9394db1f03c1d688147/1786705588/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786706320","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257399175/0f01d435a70fcb0931221a3ba55138fc35c78e46/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786706320","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/2da330b703e20632e9eb2b0651e998f09749d793/ss_2da330b703e20632e9eb2b0651e998f09749d793.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719023","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/ce5303a35eabb019cd1f8d3727bb0338c1584342/ss_ce5303a35eabb019cd1f8d3727bb0338c1584342.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719023","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/d5045fa2335f9c35eb6dd27c4033703ef0882259/ss_d5045fa2335f9c35eb6dd27c4033703ef0882259.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719023","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/dfa6f65cd084baf711e86e63ab29f17de1b582f3/ss_dfa6f65cd084baf711e86e63ab29f17de1b582f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719023","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/41742f9355851af94c2223fa6c6bb82e36cf992e/ss_41742f9355851af94c2223fa6c6bb82e36cf992e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719023"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Lootbound: take risks, build your squad and create your build </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run starts with you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move across the map, choose a route that leads to valuable loot. Along the way, you will meet companions who will help you fight this difficult battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team and equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to collect a separate set of equipment for the hero and each companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items do not have fixed slots. You can rotate them and place them in the inventory as long as there is free space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item auras</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items become truly powerful when they start affecting one another. Some items have auras that strengthen weapons or armor in adjacent cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes moving an item by a single cell is enough to change the entire build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companions and abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, you control only the main hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions act on their own. They already know what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the final GUARDIAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each biome, you choose one of two boss parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each part changes the Guardian's appearance and power. After completing all biomes, you will have to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk and reward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rewards in Lootbound cannot be obtained just like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In special rooms, you are offered several options with different difficulty levels. The more valuable the reward, the harder it is to obtain with a dice roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is Lootbound...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.poster.avif?t=1786719023\" width=1138 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.webm?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.mp4?t=1786719023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-10100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["ArtDock"],"publishers":["Dreland Enterprises"],"release_date":"14 Aug, 2026"}